  "hard_rules": [
    "owner entity facts and query-relative candidate signals remain separate",
    "one immutable shard binds one exact universe and owner generation",
    "no combined mutable global FTS corpus or retained-generation rank leakage",
    "search core accepts exact shards and never resolves current or latest",
    "documents are bounded typed origin-bearing projections and never full source bodies or context artifacts",
    "callers never provide raw FTS SQL regex callbacks plugins expressions tokenizers or executable selectors",
    "exact identifier and canonical-name matching is case-sensitive",
    "explicit aliases are owner records and never fuzzy or popularity inferences",
    "text similarity shape and graph signals are Candidate-only retrieval evidence",
    "graph expansion begins from exact or explicitly permitted candidate seeds and preserves reason paths",
    "authority bands dominate approximate repetition",
    "canonical fusion uses bounded integers and ordinals with stable exact tie keys",
    "raw FTS rank values remain shard-local and are never compared between corpora",
    "every candidate exposes all contributions caps penalties skipped failed partial lanes and owner evidence",
    "approximate no-hit is never authoritative absence",
    "exact miss requires complete owner projection index query privacy and conflict gates plus owner negative authority",
    "pagination and continuation bind exact retained shards result manifests requests profiles and cumulative budgets",
    "search never calls context and ranking never selects a hidden context root",
    "no lineage replacement migration impact safety runtime or edit conclusion in E4-A",
    "no model embedding CBM source execution filesystem network process editor client or raw storage behavior",
    "missing implementations probes corpora benchmarks thresholds or checksums are blocking and never pass",
    "no Cargo Rust source or CI during documentation phase"
  ],
